<title>USA: Tenneco sets $0.30/shr quarterly dividend.</title>
<headline>Tenneco sets $0.30/shr quarterly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tenneco Inc said on Tuesday that it has declared its first quarterly dividend of $0.30 a share following the company's spin-off of its shipbuilding unit and the merger of Tenneco Energy with El Paso Energy Corp.</p>
<p>In December, Tenneco spun off its Newport News Shipbuilding Inc business to shareholders, the company said.</p>
<p>Tenneco, which had paid a $0.45 a share quarterly dividend prior to the restructuring, has focused its operations on packaging and automotive parts, the company said.</p>
</text>
